WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.320
This is it.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.910
This is where I received years
of training under Master Asia.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.160
So this is it.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.700
That's right.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:47.410
And now it's the place to train
so that I can control...

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.460
...my Super Mode!

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.960
Well, everybody.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.050
Here in the South American
Guyana Highlands...

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.550
...Domon Kasshu is in the
midst of training.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:03.260
After the mysterious masked
Fighter, Schwarz Bruder...

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.350
...made it clear to Domon
that he lacked ability...

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:12.560
...Domon returned to where
he had trained with his master.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:16.190
To understand the Shining
Gundam Super Mode...

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.530
...to use it to defeat
the Devil Gundam.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.530
Will everything turn out
the way he hopes it will?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.490
Today's opponent is his
destined rival...

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.200
...Chibodee Crocket
and his Gundam crew.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.850
However, Chibodee doesn't
quite seem to be himself.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.630
And now!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.510
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:43.550
Steal the Secret!
Scheme of the Beautiful Warriors

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.070
My Cyclone Punch!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.240
Not bad!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.250
Oh, Chibodee!

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.260
These are...?!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.300
Devil Gundam cells!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.750
Take this! And this!
And this! And this!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.000
Here! Here! Here! Here!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.210
Chibodee!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.920
Stop it, Chibodee!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:00.960
It's over!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.720
Your opponent can't move at all!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.880
What?!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.890
Wh-what the...?!

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:11.170
Did I really cause
all of this damage?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.430
Did I do this?!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.190
What's happening to me?!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.240
Chibodee...

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.320
What's the matter with him?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.490
That's pretty sad.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.330
At this rate, it looks like
Neo America's dream is over.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.710
It seems he's become
fearful of fighting...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.170
...and has lost sight of himself.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.050
What are you saying, old man?!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:47.140
At times like these,
one must forget everything...

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:52.180
...and find peace within himself
before he faces any fight.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.060
Yes.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.320
The greater and stronger
the opponent...

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.650
...the more the Fighter
will grow in ability.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.160
If he can fight until he re-ignites
the fuse of his battle spirit...

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:07.240
...he can return once again
to being a shining star.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:14.000
I sure hope there's a Fighter
out there who could help him.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.210
Yes.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.410
A very strong rival.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.780
Who does that old man think he is?

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.800
He's got no idea.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.760
No. That man's absolutely right.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.010
What Chibodee really needs
right now...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.890
...is a challenging fight!

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.200
Yeah, but who could he fight?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.020
I know someone.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.510
Yes.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:38.520
And the man's name is...

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.310
...Domon Kasshu!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.900
That went well.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.010
Yes.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:58.250
It's best that brave young lions
train against each other.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.990
Now, I'd better be on my way.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.470
Hey!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.580
Open the door!

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.180
I'm home!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.590
Why'd they lock the door?

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:16.980
Here goes!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.440
Shirley! Get me some water!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.290
Bunny!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.360
Cath!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.860
Janet!

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.700
Why isn't anyone home?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.330
What's this?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.580
Oh, it's a letter.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.210
Stupid!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.900
How dare those girls...

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:54.460
...go off on their own like that!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.140
"Dear Chibodee..."

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:01.300
"We can't stand the sight
of a broken man..."

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.360
"...so we have left for
the Guyana Highlands..."

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:08.200
"...to defeat Domon Kasshu,
since you obviously can't."

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:09.720
"Yes..."

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.580
"...we will carry out the honor
of the Gundam Fighter crew."

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:16.740
"P.S. If you want to,
you can meet us there."

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.500
What do they think they're doing?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:52.980
Master...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.710
I don't have a chance
against Master's powers...

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:18.420
...if I can't overcome
a simple waterfall.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.680
Damn!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.140
All Domon's doing is
jumping into the river.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:30.030
Is that what he calls training?

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.360
I'd rather not stick around
this place for too much longer.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.320
The air is so clean here...

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.670
...but there's nothing to do.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:46.370
Well?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.290
This is our chance.
I think she's fallen asleep.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.550
What a fool.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.050
Listen.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.360
If there's a call from Chibodee,
we're all going to ignore it.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.330
But...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:01.390
...we're not actually trying to defeat
the Shining Gundam, right?

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.260
What're you saying now?

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:08.600
We're here so we can copy the
Shining Gundam's combat data.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:11.980
But that's not right.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.390
Yeah.

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.460
Just for a short period of time...

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.450
...we're going to have to
start acting like we used to.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.520
"Like we used to"?

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.660
You mean, way back then?

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.040
Yes.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:26.660
When we used to live in the heart
of New York, same as Chibodee.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.750
Back when people called us
useless, delinquent girls.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.540
We did a lot of things back then.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:38.040
Stealing, swindling,
rioting in the city...

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.940
We knew it was wrong...

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.060
...but we had no choice if
we wanted to survive.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.230
Because...

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.950
...it was our one dream to
someday go to the Colony.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.760
But things didn't go as planned.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.360
We got as far as sneaking
onto the shuttle.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:55.070
We almost made it.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.530
But they caught us
at the last minute.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.770
It was then that we met him
by coincidence.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.700
Chibodee Crocket.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.290
Well...

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.780
You've got great glimmering eyes.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.880
They remind me of myself
in the old days.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.290
How about this, you girls?

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.390
You want to come work for me?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.100
I'll treat you good.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.960
I was thrilled.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:32.060
It was the very first time anyone
treated us like real people.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.140
Yes.

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.820
And we all made a pledge.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.150
No matter when and
no matter what...

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:39.860
...we will do anything
to try to help Chibodee!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.140
And so...

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.550
...we'll find the Shining Gundam's
weakness from this data...

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.390
...and have Chibodee win
no matter what!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.780
I fell asleep.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.920
I must've been exhausted
ever since Shinjuku.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.220
Right. I'd better go work on
the Super Mode data.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.350
I got it.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.090
This is perfect.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:09.520
What?!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.510
I'll shoot if you move!

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:15.650
Just what are you doing here?

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.850
Can't you tell by looking?!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.500
And this isn't a joke!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.530
Don't you try to stop us!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:24.030
You think it's right for the crew
of a Gundam Fighter to do this?!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.240
Talking about this?

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.010
B-but that's...!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.870
We now have all the data
on the Shining Gundam!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.380
Let's go!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.760
Oh, no! The data!

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.260
Come back!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.290
They've got some nerve going off
without me like that.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.970
Do they actually think they can
defeat Domon Kasshu?

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.690
This sure is an incredible place, though.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.860
You don't get this kind of scenery
on the Colony.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.830
Look how tall that waterfall is.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.570
Huh? Is that a person up there?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.110
Domon Kasshu!

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.580
From Neo Japan!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.210
What's he doing?!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.170
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.100
What's up, Neo Japan?
What's he doing here?

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.690
I can feel great energy from him.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:54.410
But what's he up to?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.240
No way!

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.960
Could he be fighting all alone
against the Devil Gundam?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.970
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.330
He's just not troubled about it
like I am.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.500
He's pushing himself,
as hard as he can...

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.770
...and only thinking of
facing it head on!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.650
I understand!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.480
I'll do the same thing, and smash
the terror of the Devil Gundam...

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.110
...with my fighting spirit!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.510
The lion cubs sharpen
their claws.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.540
This is getting interesting.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.000
The two Fighters ignite a storm.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.700
We went through all this
trouble to get that data!

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:56.810
And we screwed up.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.230
I can't believe she's still
chasing after us!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.220
Listen. Let's split up in two.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.280
Okay!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.020
Where did they go?

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.780
I've got to get that combat data
back from them.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.410
She didn't see us.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.700
Let's go now.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.910
Why did you scream?

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.700
I've always hated snakes.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:26.090
I found you.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.340
Return the data!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.220
Not yet...

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.820
...after all my training, I still
can't cut a tree with this sword.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.070
That's a sorry excuse for a sword,
Neo Japan.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:04.790
What?!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.330
Chibodee Crocket!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.260
It's you again!

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.010
Do you actually plan to use that
sword against the Devil Gundam?

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.670
This has nothing to do with you!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.660
Actually, it does.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:22.930
Domon Kasshu...

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:25.230
I challenge you to a Gundam Fight!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:27.690
What?

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.870
It might be worth fighting you to
check the results of my training.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.330
I accept!

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.250
That's what I wanted to hear.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:42.120
Maxter!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.440
Gundam Fight!

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.050
Ready!

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.940
Go!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.400
This is awesome!

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:28.210
I can come up with all kinds of
new techniques by fighting you!

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:31.020
Chibodee's showing great energy!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.670
This is the best kind of training!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.130
Look.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.640
Those two are fighting.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:43.050
Chibodee must've come after us!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.310
It doesn't look like it's broken.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.060
But you'll have to keep it still.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.400
Thank you.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:53.110
But what's the idea of
stealing data on our Gundam?

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.980
We did it for Chibodee...

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.320
Bunny! Cath!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:16:59.730
What happened?

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.830
It's Rain!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.860
Hey, Shirley.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.380
Cath hurt her leg.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.340
It's nothing.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:08.250
Rain was kind enough to fix it up.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.160
You've come to get the data back?

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.050
Think you can win against the
three of us?

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:16.050
More importantly, we have to
get away from here!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.220
Wh-what's going on...?!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.510
Rain!

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:28.380
Hurry!

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.860
R-right.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.030
The water's rising!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.570
We could be in trouble!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.240
I know!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.190
What are you going to do?

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:39.190
I'm calling Chibodee
to come and save us.

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.490
No, Bunny!

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.810
Why not?

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.450
You should get him to
come and help us.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:44.980
No way.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.320
That's one thing I can't do!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.420
My pride as a crewmember
won't allow it!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.070
You're wrong.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:53.660
Crew and Fighter are united as one.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.510
You're true teammates because
you always support each other.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.970
There's nothing embarrassing
about having him save you.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.470
Shirley.

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.920
Call Chibodee for us.

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:05.680
Please do it.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.330
All right, then.

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:12.100
We'll call Chibodee.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.540
That's an SOS!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.870
Is it Shirley and the crew?

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.460
What's the matter, Chibodee?

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.210
J-just hold on a minute!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.960
What the hell?!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.130
Chibodee!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.640
L-look at that!

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:49.100
Don't worry about it!
I'll take care of this wave!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:54.400
Shining Finger!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.220
Think you can stop that?!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:09.960
Chibodee!

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.820
I've got to do it!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.790
I've got to save the girls!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:24.710
Chibodee...

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:26.920
Since when have you had
that kind of power?

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:28.310
Fool!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.200
Why are you standing there?!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.560
Your crew's in danger too,
you know!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.560
Rain!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.940
Domon!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.940
Rain!

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.690
Please help me, Domon!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.200
Rain...!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.870
What the...?!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:59.510
Shining Finger!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.220
Th-this is my power?!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.400
Well done, Domon!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.360
I know that voice!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.490
Looks like I didn't have to
come to your aid, after all.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.060
However...

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.200
...your real training
is just beginning!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.200
What?!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.820
Can you harness that power...

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:32.570
...when you want to...

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.670
...and when you need to?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.420
That's the question.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.660
Domon!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:44.280
I'll continue to watch you train
with great interest!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.680
Shut up!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.680
We went to all that trouble...

00:20:58.680 --> 00:20:59.770
Shirley!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.530
I hope you understand how I feel!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.620
Yes.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.730
We failed you miserably
as your crew.

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.740
Come on, girls. Let's go.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.040
Where are you going, Shirley?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.880
Thanks to you guys, I was able to
come up with a new technique.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:23.580
However...

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.100
...before I can live up
to this crest...

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.140
...I still have a long way to go.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.420
So, we have to keep training.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.100
Myself and you girls.

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:36.570
I'll teach you what it means
to be a crewmember. So, be prepared!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.100
Chibodee...

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.570
Chibodee!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.320
Chibodee!

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.900
Chibodee!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.410
You've all got great looking eyes!

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.500
Just like the old days!

00:21:58.790 --> 00:21:59.880
Domon...

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.680
About our training...

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:03.840
...let's do our best, too.

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:06.760
You and I.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.510
Yeah.

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:33.240
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:37.620
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:42.090
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.630
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:52.800
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:58.520
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:03.770
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:10.320
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:14.450
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:20.460
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:37.460
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:40.170
Domon trains in
the Guyana Highlands...

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:44.230
...while Sai Saici and Argo
fight a fierce battle!

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:45.090
However...

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:46.430
...approaching ever closer...

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:49.530
...is the evil hand
of the Death Army!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.360
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:55.940
Fierce Battle!
Dragon Gundam versus Bolt Gundam.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:24:01.200
Fierce Battle!
Dragon Gundam vs. Bolt Gundam

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:58.950
Ready! Go!
